## Item Archived email message
 ## This message is sent to a submitter when Infoscience curator
 ## has approved the submission, and the item is maked available into
 ## the repository.
 ##
 ## {0} Title of the item
 ## {1} The handle identifier of the item
 ## {2} The submitters full name
 ##
 #set($subject = "Infoscience: Your submission is approved and available")
 
 Hello ${params[2]},
 
 Thank you for your submission to Infoscience: "${params[0]}".
 After checking, the Library has validated your record and made it available online: ${params[1]}
 
 By disseminating your research output via Infoscience, you contribute to Open Science and knowledge sharing.
  
 You can find useful information for submitters here: https://help-infoscience.epfl.ch
 - how can I see how often my publication is viewed and downloaded?
 - how can I add my publication on my people page?
 - can my publication be submitted in open access?
 ... and more!
 
 We welcome your feedback! Contact us at infoscience@epfl.ch
 
 Best regards,
 
 Infoscience Team
 EPFL Library
